    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM201 · Assessment 1/5</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13226 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM201 · Đầu điểm 1/5</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13226 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">30'/group<br><br>Presentations in slot: 28,29,30</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">All Los</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">'Group presentation &amp; Written report</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">All chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Each group of 4-5 students will choose a real company in tourism/travel sector to learn about the aspects: organizational structure, operation systems, services provided, customer segment, their partners....<br><br>Each group will make an in-class PowerPoint presentation of about 30 minutes.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">All assignments should be typed and double-spaced with 11-point font, and must be submitted in both soft and hard copy. A deduction of 10% of the assignment mark will be applied for each day of late submission or every 350 words over/ below the limit (see below).<br><br>The report and presentation should follow this format: (1) structure and background of firm; (2) description of their current situation; (3) analysis of the business operational practices; (4) conclusions and recommendations; (5) references; (6) annex. Word limit: 3,500 words +/- 10%.<br><br>Evaluation will be based on both presentation and written report.<br><br>Specific contact details of the interviewees including phone number, addresses, website and questions must be submitted in the Annex.<br><br>Any plagiarism will be resulted in a failure of assignment</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 9 — Group assigmnent and Individual assignment guidelines</li><li>Session 43 — Individual Assignment Submission</li><li>Session 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 9 — Group assigmnent and Individual assignment guidelines</li><li>Buổi 43 — Individual Assignment Submission</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
